<title>USA: Astrosystems says accountants resign.</title>
<headline>Astrosystems says accountants resign.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Astrosystems Inc said its independent accountants, Richard A. Eisner &amp; Co LLP, resigned.</p>
<p>According to the company, the accountants said &quot;they are no longer independent with respect to the company.&quot;</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>Officials from Astrosystems were not immediately available to comment.</p>
